cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "A Sophisticated Controllable Agent for Complex Retrieval-Augmented Generation Tasks"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2024-04-03"
authors:
  - family-names: "Diamant"
    given-names: "Nir"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/Controllable-RAG-Agent"
url: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/Controllable-RAG-Agent"
abstract: >-
  An advanced Retrieval-Augmented Generation solution for complex question
  answering. A deterministic graph acts as the brain of a highly
  controllable autonomous agent that plans, decomposes questions into
  sub-questions, retrieves across multiple purpose-built vector stores at
  different granularities, and verifies both retrieved context relevance
  and answer groundedness before responding.
keywords:
  - rag
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - langgraph
  - ai-agents
  - question-answering
  - hallucination-detection
  - llm
license: Apache-2.0
